This product contains software adapted from the SkillsBench project:
https://github.com/benchflow-ai/skillsbench

The bundled tasks/ directory is based on SkillsBench commit
a7028dfd37cfff86acaf248656cdbd9ad0179592 and includes modifications for the
CoEvoSkills evaluation environment. Modified task files are distributed under
the same Apache-2.0 terms.

This product contains software adapted from the Harbor project's Terminus-2
agent implementation:
https://github.com/harbor-framework/harbor

The adapted code is primarily located under libs/terminus_agent/. It has been
modified to support dynamic skill loading, skill evolution, independent
surrogate verification, ground-truth oracle orchestration, and experiment
logging.

The skill-creator meta-skill under meta_skills/skill-creator/ retains its
upstream LICENSE.txt.
